#: healthcheck_system/flash_writes.py:58
#, fuzzy
msgid "Checks if system is not writing too much to flash storage."
msgstr "Sjekker om systemet skriver for mye til flash-minne."

#: healthcheck_system/flash_writes.py:78
msgid "There is no flash device detected in system."
msgstr "Fant ingen flash-enhet for systemet."

#: healthcheck_system/flash_writes.py:81
msgid ""
"Check found no flash device in system. This is most likely because there "
"is just no such device."
msgstr ""
"Sjekken fant ingen flash-enhet for systemet. Det finnes antagelig ingen slik "
"tilknyttet enhet."

#: healthcheck_system/flash_writes.py:94
msgid ""
"Number of writes on MMC storages is inherently linked to lifespan of it. "
"Compared to some other regular storages where excessive writes are "
"expected and lifespan still can regularly meet lifespan of the device, "
"the excessive writes to MMC can shorten lifespan to just a year or two. "
"The that excessive writes are not regularly covered by warranty."
msgstr ""
"Antall skrivinger til MMC-lager er iboende tilknyttet deres levetid. "
"Sammenlignet med andre lager der kontinuerlig skriving er forventet og "
"levetiden ikke er et problem, er det samme for MMC-lager noe som forkorter "
"levetiden til et år eller to. Slik bruk dekkes ikke av garantien."

#: healthcheck_system/flash_writes.py:101
msgid "The calculation is since boot up that was {} ago."
msgstr "Utregning siden systemoppstart for {} siden."

#: healthcheck_system/flash_writes.py:103
#, fuzzy
msgid "The amount of recorded sector writes is {}."
msgstr "{} registrerte sektorskrivinger."

#: healthcheck_system/flash_writes.py:105
msgid "That is {} sector writes per hour."
msgstr "Det er {} sektorskrivinger per time."

#: healthcheck_system/flash_writes.py:109
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Keep write heavy operations on other storage types, specially if the MMC "
"storage can't be replaced (such as being soldered on board not inserted "
"in SD slot). These are but not limited to services for file sharing and "
"caching as well as databases or other data collectors."
msgstr ""
"Hold tunge skriveoperasjoner til andre lagringstyper, spesielt hvis MMC-"
"lageret ikke kan erstattes (som hvis det er loddet fast på kortet, og ikke "
"satt inn i en SD-kortplass). Dette betyr (men ikke kun) tjenester for "
"fildeling og hurtiglagring, sågar også databaser og andre datainnsamlere."

#: healthcheck_system/flash_writes.py:120
msgid "Number of writes to MMC storage does not exceed limits"
msgstr "Antall skrivinger til MMC-lager overskrider ikke grensene"

#: healthcheck_system/flash_writes.py:130
msgid ""
"The amount of writes is hight but it is too soon after boot to reliably "
"assess the impact"
msgstr ""
"Mengden skrivinger er høyt, men det har gått for lite tid siden "
"systemoppstart for å anslå innvirkningen."

#: healthcheck_system/flash_writes.py:134
msgid ""
"It is possible that this is just write happenig right after the boot and "
"all will settle down in a while."
msgstr ""
"Det er mulig at dette er en skriving som skjer like etter systemoppstart og "
"at det vil roe seg ned om en stund."

#: healthcheck_system/flash_writes.py:146
msgid "The amount of writes is considerably high"
msgstr "Mengden skrivinger er betydelig høy"

#: healthcheck_system/flash_writes.py:153
msgid "The amount of writes is really high!"
msgstr "Mengden skrivinger er virkelig høyt."

#: healthcheck_system/flash_writes.py:156
msgid "You should act now to prevent permanent hardware damage!"
msgstr "Du bør foreta deg noe nå for å forhindre maskinvareskade!"

#: healthcheck_system/free_ram.py:38
